    <div style="break-before: page; margin-top: 6pt"><p style="margin: 0pt">&#160;</p></div>
    <!-- Field: /Page --></ix:exclude>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">The Company used a Monte Carlo simulation model to
calculate the fair value of the 2024 Convertible Bridge Notes. The 2024 Convertible Bridge Notes were classified within Level 3 of the
fair value hierarchy at the initial measurement date, due to the use of unobservable inputs. The key inputs into the model for the 2024
Convertible Bridge Note were as follows:</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-012025-03-31_custom_ConvertibleBridgeNotesMember" escape="true" id="Fact000766" name="us-gaap:FairValueAssetsAndLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringAndNonrecurringBasisValuationTechniquesTableTextBlock"><p id="xdx_89C_eus-gaap--FairValueAssetsAndLiabilitiesMeasuredOnRecurringAndNonrecurringBasisValuationTechniquesTableTextBlock_hus-gaap--DebtInstrumentAxis__custom--ConvertibleBridgeNotesMember_zQT23pVsriDg" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_8B9_zMoyDfQkfZI3" style="display: none">Schedule
of Key Inputs of Convertible Bridge Note</span></span></p>

