<td style="width: 15pt; text-align: right"><span id="xdx_F0B_zucP7Lld4yc4" style="font-size: 10pt">(1)</span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><span id="xdx_F18_zyvAnFtmmQlb" style="font-size: 10pt"><ix:footnote id="Footnote000805" xml:lang="en-US">Probability assessments include the probabilities that subsequent
successful capital raises (in terms of amounts raised and timing) are not executed and the probability that the securities issuable under
the convertible bridge notes are not timely registered.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr></table>


</ix:nonNumeric><p id="xdx_8A7_zyA4fomqjZi7" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<ix:nonNumeric contextRef="From2025-01-01to2025-03-31" escape="true" id="Fact000807" name="us-gaap:FairValueAssetsMeasuredOnRecurringBasisUnobservableInputReconciliationTextBlock"><p id="xdx_899_eus-gaap--FairValueAssetsMeasuredOnRecurringBasisUnobservableInputReconciliationTextBlock_zaT7GGJMypJf" style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">The following table summarizes the changes in the
carrying value of the 2024 Convertible Bridge Notes:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><span id="xdx_8B4_zypomp0eI8Rj" style="display: none">Schedule
of Fair Value Measurement using Significant Unobservable Inputs</span></span></p>

