successful capital raises (in terms of amounts raised and timing) are not executed and the probability that the securities issuable under
the convertible bridge notes are not timely registered.</ix:footnote></span></td>
</tr></table>


<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0">&#160;</p>

